Fix net worth using full balance and fix category propagation to matching transactions

Net worth: compute_net_worth no longer forces as_of_date=now() for the
current snapshot — it passes None so get_account_balance sums all
transactions without a date cutoff.  This fixes the issue where
future-dated transactions were excluded from the current balance.

Category propagation: fixed two bugs in learn_from_correction:
1. SQL NULL handling — "category_id != X" excludes NULL rows; now uses
   OR(IS NULL, != X) so uncategorized transactions are included.
2. Whitespace mismatch — descriptions stored with multiple consecutive
   spaces didn't match patterns with collapsed spaces; now uses exact
   case-insensitive match on the original description plus a fuzzy
   match with whitespace normalization.
